Synchronize Symitar Action - live integration fixture.

This file exists only so the live-integration workflow has one known-present
local HELPFILE to compare against SYM 627. Every scenario in that workflow runs
with dry-run: true, so this file is never actually transferred to the Symitar
host - the run only ever reports that it *would* be.

Do not deploy this file to SYM 627 by hand. The workflow asserts
files-deployed = 1, which holds precisely because the file is absent remotely.
